      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Mágico. O grito de Mismagius soa como um encantamento. Embora normalmente atormente os inimigos, em casos raros seu poder pode trazer felicidade. Ele costuma aparecer nos lugares mais inesperados.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 12 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mismagius é a evolução final de Misdreavus.</p><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Ally Switch, Attract, Burning Jealousy, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Embargo, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Hyper Voice, Icy Wind, Imprison, Laser Focus, Lash Out, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Magical Leaf, Mystical Fire, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Ominous Wind, Pain Split, Payback, Phantom Force, Poltergeist, Power Gem, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Snowscape, Spite, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Will-O-Wisp, Wonder Room</p>",
